Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.67,0:01:13.04,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HD0BA90&}1{\c} {\c&HB2A7FF&}2{\c} {\c&HFFA0D2&}3{\c} {\c&H84E1FF&}4
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.09,0:01:14.30,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HD0BA90&}隠してもダメ！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.09,0:01:14.30,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HD0BA90&}藏着也不行！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.30,0:01:15.68,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFDDA4&}アピってもダメ！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.30,0:01:15.68,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HD0BA90&\}表现出来也不行！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.68,0:01:17.32,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HD0BA90&}フィクションのラブコメは
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.68,0:01:17.32,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HD0BA90&}书本里的恋爱喜剧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.32,0:01:18.40,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HD0BA90&}嘘ばかり…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.32,0:01:18.40,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HD0BA90&}那都是假的……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.47,0:01:19.76,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HB2A7FF&}焦ったらバレ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.47,0:01:19.76,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HB2A7FF&}一着急就会露馅
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.76,0:01:21.22,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HB2A7FF&}デレちゃったら負け？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.76,0:01:21.22,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HB2A7FF&}害羞了就输了么？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.22,0:01:23.04,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HB2A7FF&}下心隠すのも
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.22,0:01:23.04,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HB2A7FF&}七七八八小心思
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.04,0:01:23.98,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HB2A7FF&}必死です!!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.04,0:01:23.98,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HB2A7FF&}非得藏住不可！！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.98,0:01:25.35,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFA0D2&}触ってもいい？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.98,0:01:25.35,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFA0D2&}可以摸你吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.35,0:01:26.73,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFA0D2&}ドキッてしてる？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.35,0:01:26.73,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFA0D2&}有没有心动？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.73,0:01:28.36,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFA0D2&}子ども扱いしても
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.73,0:01:28.36,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFA0D2&}把我成当小孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.36,0:01:29.44,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFA0D2&}変わんない{\fn霞鹜文楷 Medium\b0}♡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.36,0:01:29.44,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFA0D2&}我也不会收敛哦{\fn霞鹜文楷 Medium\b0}♡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.44,0:01:30.94,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&H84E1FF&}分かってないな
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.44,0:01:30.94,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&H84E1FF&}你还是不懂呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.94,0:01:32.32,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&H84E1FF&}ズバッといきな！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.94,0:01:32.32,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&H84E1FF&}那我就直说了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.32,0:01:33.99,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&H84E1FF&}親友の特権も
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.32,0:01:33.99,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&H84E1FF&}我或许也有
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.99,0:01:35.11,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&H84E1FF&}あるかも...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.99,0:01:35.11,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&H84E1FF&}身为亲友的特权……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.11,0:01:37.78,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFA0D2&}作戦も駆け引きも
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.11,0:01:37.78,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFA0D2&}作战也好、计谋也好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.78,0:01:39.99,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&H84E1FF&}君には届かない
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.78,0:01:39.99,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&H84E1FF&}对你统统没用
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.99,0:01:43.28,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HD0BA90&}どうして好きにさせたの？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.99,0:01:43.28,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HD0BA90&}我为什么会喜欢你？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.28,0:01:48.60,OPJP EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HD0BA90&}ラブコメは両思いじゃなきゃダメ！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.28,0:01:48.60,OPCN EP01,OPED-INSERT:OP_lyrics,0,0,0,,{\c&HD0BA90&}恋爱喜剧就一定得是两情相悦！
